 "summary": "A blue surface-mount LED in a 1.6 mm × 0.8 mm (0603) chip package 0.4 mm high, with a clear encapsulant. At 20 mA it gives 120 to 270 mcd at a dominant wavelength of 460 to 475 nm from 2.7 to 3.4 V, over a 120° viewing angle. Parts are sorted into intensity, forward-voltage and wavelength bins. It is RoHS compliant, MSL 3, supplied on EIA tape and reel and suited to infrared reflow.",
